          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tempête comes from Old French tempeste, from Vulgar Latin tempesta, from Latin tempestās 'weather, storm', built on tempus 'time' (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
